  "description": "Seong Geun-Jong is possessed by a ghost while filming a horror movie. Geun-Jong, who has been suffering from ghosts visiting him at dawn, hears a rumor about a freshman at his university named Jeong Hae-Tae who sees ghosts. Geun-Jong desperately seeks out Hae-Tae to ask for help. Hae-Tae tries to refuse, but falls for Geun-Jong's charm, who has become a pitiful handsome man due to lack of sleep. And so the two begin a soft and strange journey together to shake off the ghost.\n\n(Source: Bomtoon, translated)\n\n*Note:\n\\-The side stories are rated R19.\n\\- Includes five extra chapters.*",
